  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-250000053</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projet d&apos;am&#xe9;lioration de la GIRE dans le Bani et Sourou</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intermediate phase prepares  for the creation of functional watershed Agencies (Agence de l&#x2019;eau) to manage water resources in Bani and Sourou basins. Water agencies are foreseen in the national policy IWRM, but the institutional setup and legal documents guiding the set-up are not yet ready. This project will therefore contribute to the improvement of water management in the Sourou and Bani basins. It&#x2019;s specific objectives are: a) Facilitate the drafting and finalization of all legal documents and regulatory requirements based on input from all actors; b) Prepare water users in the Sourou and Bani basins for creation water management agencies; and c) Improve the OPIDIN early warning system and the transfer of its management to DNH. The basins are chosen for accessibility, our ongoing engagement in Sourou and potential to work transboundary, high potential for conservation and economic potential. DNH and SNV will implement this project.</narrative>
  </description>
